# ── Optional deployment overrides ────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) only if you need to override something.
# On GitHub Actions set these as repository variables instead.

# Site origin — canonical URLs, sitemap, RSS, Open Graph.
# Default: site.url in blog.config.ts.
SITE_URL=https://gnutlam.github.io

# Must stay "/": the site is served from the root of its domain
# (<username>.github.io or a custom domain). Any other value fails the build.
BASE_PATH=/

# Everything else (copy, avatars, socials) lives in blog.config.ts.
